{"availability":"available","full":"Space-Nebula/stellar-nebula-frontend","name":"stellar-nebula-frontend","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":62,"created":"2026-02-15T16:12:43Z","updated":"2026-09-27T20:31:53Z","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://nebula-nomad.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T01:04:57.828Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T01:04:57.828Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T01:04:57.828Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T01:04:57.828Z","stars":0,"forks":62}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Nebula Nomad: On-Chain Space Exploration Sim – The frontend for a serene, decentralized space exploration game on the Stellar blockchain. Drift through procedurally generated nebulae, harvest stardust resources as Stellar assets, and upgrade your NFT ship in a chill, combat-free experience. Built with React, TypeScript, Vite, Stellar SDK, and Three.js for immersive, mobile-first visuals.","This repo powers the web app interface, connecting to the backend smart contracts via Soroban. It's designed for seamless Web3 integration: wallet connects, real-time txns, and on-chain procedural generation seeded by Stellar ledgers for fair, verifiable exploration.","Nebula Nomad reimagines Web3 gaming as relaxing discovery. No grinding or PvPjust captain your customizable spaceship (NFT modules), scan cosmic anomalies for loot, and trade on Stellar's DEX. Key innovations:"],"features":["Ledger-Seeded Procedural Gen: Nebula layouts and rarity use Stellar transaction hashes as RNG seeds transparent and tamper-proof.","Micro-Transaction Economy: Harvest costs 0.01 XLM; upgrades burn resources for yields. All on-chain for true ownership.","Modern Stack: React 18+ for dynamic UI, Three.js for particle-based nebulae (lightweight, performant on mobile), Stellar SDK for frictionless blockchain ops.","Wallet Integration: Connect via Freighter or Albedo with full Ledger Hardware Wallet support (Hardware Wallet Guide); sign txns for scans/upgrades.","Immersive Nebula View: Three.js canvas renders procedural clouds with interactive scanning (click to harvest)."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Space-Nebula/stellar-nebula-frontend/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b7509d63309e2e9bc05822864d1518b945e007fa4054df1c79ab0fa7339f8d7a","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T01:04:57.993Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T01:04:57.993Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Nebula Nomad: On-Chain Space Exploration Sim – The frontend for a serene, decentralized space exploration game on the Stellar blockchain. Drift through procedurally generated nebulae, harvest stardust resources as Stellar assets, and upgrade your NFT ship in a chill, combat-free experience. Built with React, TypeScript, Vite, Stellar SDK, and Three.js for immersive, mobile-first visuals.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Space-Nebula/stellar-nebula-frontend/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"This repo powers the web app interface, connecting to the backend smart contracts via Soroban. It's designed for seamless Web3 integration: wallet connects, real-time txns, and on-chain procedural generation seeded by Stellar ledgers for fair, verifiable exploration.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Space-Nebula/stellar-nebula-frontend/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"b7509d63309e2e9bc05822864d1518b945e007fa4054df1c79ab0fa7339f8d7a","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Space-Nebula/stellar-nebula-frontend/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T01:04:57.993Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-27T20:31:53Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Space-Nebula/stellar-nebula-frontend/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T01:04:57.994Z","hash":"b7509d63309e2e9bc05822864d1518b945e007fa4054df1c79ab0fa7339f8d7a","originalBytes":6949,"storedBytes":6949,"truncated":f